lavender: SMS line - wired IOSurface memory by creating process, published or only held (who holds 1.2 GB)

- SweetSurface: creator name and a list of every live surface; sweet_surface_report() sums the buffer
  surfaces by creator, split into published and only held (with their retain counts); the sampler calls it
- made by xnu/src/mk_surfstat.py

